# .claudeignore - what Claude should not spend tokens on.
#
# Claude Code 2.1.278 does not read a file with this name (checked: the string is not
# in the installed binary), so on its own this file does nothing today. It is kept
# because it was asked for and because other tools and later versions may honour it.
# What works right now, and is kept in step with this list:
#   .ignore                 skipped by Grep, Glob and the file picker (ripgrep syntax)
#   .claude/settings.json   permissions.deny blocks the Read tool on the heavy files
# To look into one of these anyway, have the GLM helper on ollama pull out the few lines
# needed instead of reading the file (see CLAUDE.md, "Reading big generated files").

# ==========================================
# 1. LOCKFILES (the biggest token sinks)
# ==========================================
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
Cargo.lock
poetry.lock
Gemfile.lock

# ==========================================
# 2. DEPENDENCIES & PACKAGES
# ==========================================
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
vendor/
.pnpm-store/

# ==========================================
# 3. BUILD & COMPILE OUTPUTS
# ==========================================
dist/
build/
built/
build_*/
web-ext-artifacts/
.next/
out/
output/
target/
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map

# ==========================================
# 4. MEDIA & BINARY FILES
# ==========================================
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.ico
*.pdf
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.mp4

# ==========================================
# 5. LOGS, CACHES & GENERATED DATA
# ==========================================
*.log
.cache/
.turbo/
coverage/
.pytest_cache/
tmp/
logs/
.dev-profile/
.e2e-downloads/
lint-*.json

# combined-locales.json is generated from chrome/_locales (localescript.mjs) and only
# repeats what is already there, at 14 000 lines.
combined-locales.json

# ==========================================
# 6. VENDORED LIBRARIES (generated from npm by the build, not committed)
# ==========================================
chrome/player/modules/hls.mjs
chrome/player/modules/hls.worker.js
chrome/player/modules/dash.mjs
chrome/player/modules/pako.mjs
chrome/player/modules/fuse.mjs
chrome/player/modules/sortable.mjs
chrome/player/modules/sweetalert.mjs
chrome/player/modules/vad/ort.wasm.mjs
chrome/player/modules/reencoder/mp4-muxer.mjs
chrome/player/modules/reencoder/webm.mjs
chrome/player/modules/gif/gif.mjs
chrome/player/modules/gif/gif.worker.js
chrome/player/modules/mp4box/
chrome/player/modules/coloris.mjs

# ==========================================
# 7. IDE & GIT INTERNAL
# ==========================================
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
